{
  "chapter": "STEAM_AGE",
  "description": "These ores are just a start. GregTech veins are huge, so §2resource scarcity isn't a worry§r. Use your starting §9hv prospector§r to §9find veins§r with a simple right-click and its §5search function§r.


---



§6Gold§r: Common in surface magnetite veins. Crucial for progression (currency, electronics). You'll need a lot.

§7Iron§r: Found in iron veins or basaltic/granitic mineral sand. Essential for early progression (plates, tools, etc.).


---



§fTin§r: Best yield from surface Cassiterite veins. Key for many necessary alloys, so you'll revisit these often.

§4Redstone§r: Only in deep ruby veins in the otherworld (deepslate layer, more dangerous). Vital for automation; also yields rare earths and mercury.",
